        <activityName xml:lang="en">Window frame, aluminium, Hydro, Circal, Wicline 75evo, U=1.2W/m2K, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Window frame, aluminium, Hydro, Circal, Wicline 75evo, U=1.2W/m2K, at regional storage
Transport distance determined from production site to Berne.;
UUID: 3a8c93a3-f89e-30d6-8203-ee0ead9dbfff
Included are the production of an aluminium window frame as well as the transport from the production site to Switzerland. Aluminium with a recycling share of 82.1% is used.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Industry data.
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data survey at SAPA Building Systems AG. 
Extrapolations: Some generic datasets from ecoinvent have been used.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3a8c93a3-f89e-30d6-8203-ee0ead9dbfff.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
